<DocsPageSection>
    <DocsPageSectionHeader Title="Close button">
        Adding a <Code>CloseButton</Code> automatically applies the padding and positioning needed for dismissal.
        An explicit <Code>Dismisable</Code> value overrides this behavior: use <Code>true</Code> for custom close controls or <Code>false</Code> to opt out of automatic styling.
        The close button's <Code>AutoClose</Code> parameter controls whether clicking it hides the alert.
    </DocsPageSectionHeader>
    <DocsPageSectionContent Code="CloseAlertExample" Outlined FullWidth>
        <CloseAlertExample />
    </DocsPageSectionContent>
</DocsPageSection>

<DocsPageSection>
    <DocsPageSectionHeader Title="Extra content">
